  "_readme": [
    "Korean vocabulary for the structured data that the database stores in",
    "Chinese, Traditional Chinese and English only. Korean reuses the English",
    "columns as its base and translates the closed vocabularies at render time,",
    "so Korean names have exactly one source here.",
    "Country names mirror every English name in public/data/world-airports.json.",
    "City names are the established Korean exonyms for that dataset's major",
    "cities plus every airports.city_en value; airport, terminal and facility",
    "names mirror the closed vocabularies in db/terminology/en.json. Values",
    "missing here fall through to the English column, never to Chinese."
